op('logmeanweight','A B C','LogMean','[(()=>{const m=Math.max(...p);return m+Math.log(p.reduce((s,x)=>s+Math.exp(x-m),0)/3);})()]',lambda p:[max(p)+math.log(sum(math.exp(x-max(p)) for x in p)/3)],'Three toy log importance weights are {A},{B},{C}. What is log of the mean of their exponentials?','The log-mean-exp statistic differs from the mean log weight. Statements about tightening in expectation do not imply monotonic improvement for every realized sample.','grid')
