op('elevator','Floors Stops PerFloor StopTime','RoundTime','[2*p[0]*p[2]+p[1]*p[3]]',lambda p:[2*p[0]*p[2]+p[1]*p[3]],'A toy elevator round travels up and down {Floors} floors at {PerFloor} time per floor and makes {Stops} stops of {StopTime} each. What round time results?','Stop overhead and travel both enter this simple round. Dispatch interactions, passenger capacity and random demand are outside this timing model.','grid')
