op('routing','A B Service Shortest','ExpectedWait','[(p[3]===1?Math.min(p[0],p[1]):(p[0]+p[1])/2)*p[2]]',lambda p:[(min(p[0],p[1]) if p[3]==1 else (p[0]+p[1])/2)*p[2]],'Two toy queues contain {A},{B} equal-duration jobs, each taking {Service}. Shortest {Shortest}=1 joins the shorter, 0 picks uniformly. What is expected wait for this arrival?','Routing on observed queue lengths changes this arrival’s delay. A one-arrival comparison is not a full stationary routing analysis.','grid')
op('workroute','CountA WorkA CountB WorkB ByWork','Wait','[p[4]===1?(p[1]<=p[3]?p[1]:p[3]):p[0]<=p[2]?p[1]:p[3]]',lambda p:[min(p[1],p[3]) if p[4]==1 else p[1] if p[0]<=p[2] else p[3]],'Toy queues A/B have counts {CountA}/{CountB}, outstanding work {WorkA}/{WorkB}. ByWork {ByWork}=1 picks less work; 0 picks fewer jobs. What chosen workload results?','Job counts can hide unequal sizes. Least outstanding work and least connections need not select the same server.','grid')
