op('ratearea','Start End Time','Expected','[(p[0]+p[1])*p[2]/2]',lambda p:[(p[0]+p[1])*p[2]/2],'A toy nonhomogeneous Poisson rate changes linearly from {Start} to {End} over Time {Time}. What expected event count results?','The integral of the rate gives the expected count. It does not specify the exact count that will occur in a realized interval.','grid')
